          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 37:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima omugabe Zedekia yaatuma ku bamureeta, yaamwakiira, yaamubuuriza omu nju ye bari bombi, naagira ati: Hariho ekigambo kyona ekirugire ahari MUKAMA? Yeremia yaamugira ati: kiriho. Yeremia yaagaruka yaagira ati: Noija kuheebwayo omu mikono y'omugabe wa Babulooni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.37.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.37.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 37:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi Yeremia yaagaruka yaamubuuza ati: Nkucumwireho ki, iwe n'abaheereza baawe, nari ncumwire ki ahari eri ihanga, mwaza kunta omu kihome? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.37.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.37.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
